1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 2=

8
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:47,979
We can't endure such disgrace.

9
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,140
We can't just sit and wait.

10
00:00:51,119 --> 00:00:52,359
We must fight back.

11
00:00:53,679 --> 00:00:56,280
I'd rather die
than suffer this disgrace.

12
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:58,179
No way. I need to run away.

13
00:00:58,179 --> 00:00:59,219
I can't stay here.

14
00:01:13,079 --> 00:01:14,079
What's going on?

15
00:01:14,719 --> 00:01:15,719
Unbelievable!

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Are you out of your mind?

17
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:18,599
Why are you running around there?

18
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:20,760
This is not the time to run away.

19
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,780
Wang Xu is clearly targeting Zhao Dong.

20
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:24,939
If we go out now,
we'll fall into his trap.

21
00:01:26,819 --> 00:01:27,939
Something's off here!

22
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:34,540
Dong,

23
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,340
you can give a wife to me.

24
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,680
We're buddies.

25
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,299
I'll share your burdens with you.

26
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:41,239
Silly boy.

27
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,359
This is my karma.

28
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:44,579
Your destined bond hasn't appeared yet.

29
00:01:44,579 --> 00:01:47,019
But what if you can't deliver the grain?

30
00:01:49,099 --> 00:01:51,540
I have a plan.

31
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:53,819
The Kun position hides Yin.

32
00:01:54,219 --> 00:01:55,340
The Gen soil contains water.

33
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,040
The surface is scorched,

34
00:01:58,420 --> 00:02:01,459
but three inches below,
there's a trace of cool moisture.

35
00:02:02,099 --> 00:02:03,159
A dragon hides in here.

36
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:04,159
What does that mean?

37
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:06,379
Er Gou, dig here.

38
00:02:06,379 --> 00:02:07,379
Yes.

39
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:13,219
This body is really weak.

40
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:16,860
But luckily, I can use
some art of feng shui.

41
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:24,199
The three women
Zhao Laizi took in this time

42
00:02:25,219 --> 00:02:26,659
are fair and tender.

43
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,439
What a pity.

44
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:30,099
He won't get to enjoy them.

45
00:02:30,539 --> 00:02:32,599
The officials will definitely kill him.

46
00:02:33,699 --> 00:02:35,840
It's just a pity about those fine women.

47
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,919
Back in the old days,

48
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,000
beautiful women like that,

49
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,939
we vulgar men wouldn't
even dare to covet.

50
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,719
Why not?

51
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:47,039
Now that beautiful women have fallen,

52
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:49,159
can't vulgar men like us even covet?

53
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:51,180
You mean...

54
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:53,659
We'll get some knockout drugs

55
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,120
to knock them out.

56
00:02:55,539 --> 00:02:57,340
Then we can do
whatever we want with them.

57
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:58,439
And we don't have to pay.

58
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,639
Alright, let's do it.

59
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:06,460
Bro, this bark is so dry.
Can we even eat it?

60
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,199
If we don't roast it,

61
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,819
we can't even swallow it.

62
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,879
Here, eat more,

63
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:16,900
so you can have strength.

64
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:36,539
You drank the last bowl
of vegetable soup.

65
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,939
He can't come up with the grain anyway.

66
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,599
Might as well tie him up.

67
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:45,419
At least we'll have five days of peace.

68
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:47,379
If we're lucky,

69
00:03:48,219 --> 00:03:49,979
we might even escape.

70
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:51,879
Well...

71
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,560
Whatever you say.

72
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:58,180
What if he doesn't come back

73
00:03:58,500 --> 00:03:59,539
alone?

74
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,300
We'll pretend to cooperate first.

75
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:08,000
Then strike at the perfect time.

76
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:12,639
Xi Yun, I can tell
you're no ordinary person.

77
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:14,020
You must be somebody.

78
00:04:14,939 --> 00:04:15,939
Who are you exactly?

79
00:04:19,139 --> 00:04:20,800
That's not something you should ask.

80
00:04:21,579 --> 00:04:22,579
Tch.

81
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:34,060
Dun Jia, off!

82
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:40,379
The demon is back.

83
00:04:50,379 --> 00:04:51,439
You're back.

84
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,300
You alone?

85
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:59,579
Yeah, where are they?

86
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:00,860
They're all in the house.

87
00:05:20,019 --> 00:05:21,019
Eels.

88
00:05:22,379 --> 00:05:24,600
So big!

89
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:27,899
Tie him up tightly.

90
00:05:27,899 --> 00:05:29,459
- Okay.
- Cuicui.

91
00:05:29,459 --> 00:05:30,560
Go cook the eels.

92
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,600
I cooked half an eel

93
00:05:53,860 --> 00:05:55,600
and mixed in some wild greens.

94
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:59,480
The rest should last us a few more days.

95
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:12,300
Finding those eels
must have taken some effort.

96
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,220
There's still some in the pot.

97
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:16,439
(Affection -80)
Should we save some for him?

98
00:06:16,699 --> 00:06:18,319
(Cuicui is simple and kind.)

99
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,199
(She still cares for me now.)

100
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:22,060
Why save some for him?

101
00:06:22,699 --> 00:06:24,240
Do you know how hard I swung that hoe

102
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,819
to knock him out?

103
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:27,180
Besides,

104
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:29,660
every bite he takes means less for us.

105
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:32,339
We can just starve him to death.

106
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:36,240
But he took us in,

107
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:39,540
and he found the eels.

108
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:42,980
Doesn't he deserve a share?

109
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:47,379
But we're still hungry.

110
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:49,439
Isn't it better if we eat more?

111
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,939
It's only been one day,
and you're already trying to kill me.

112
00:07:06,339 --> 00:07:08,100
You've changed way too fast.

113
00:07:08,699 --> 00:07:09,899
You vulgar scum!

114
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,519
I wouldn't even care about you.

115
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:13,579
You may be the noble lady,

116
00:07:13,939 --> 00:07:16,040
but now you are my wife.

117
00:07:16,379 --> 00:07:18,540
We have the marriage certificate.
You can't deny it.

118
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,480
Zhao Dong, you better know your place.

119
00:07:21,779 --> 00:07:23,199
Don't get any ideas about us.

120
00:07:23,579 --> 00:07:25,819
Otherwise, you'll regret it.

121
00:07:27,500 --> 00:07:30,139
Yeah, what a shameless man.

122
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,839
I'm telling you.

123
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:34,000
I'm ending our marriage.

124
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,360
Besides,

125
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:38,240
your face disgusts me.

126
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:39,600
Just shut up.

127
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:42,779
Maybe we should just knock him out.

128
00:07:43,339 --> 00:07:47,420
Looking at him scares me.

129
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,480
Okay.

130
00:07:55,139 --> 00:07:56,339
(These women)

131
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,860
(are all born rebels.)

132
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:05,420
Alright.

133
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,439
(Xun wood overcomes Kun earth.)

134
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,620
(Stomach rumbling, clearing the path.)

135
00:08:18,019 --> 00:08:19,019
What's wrong?

136
00:08:20,259 --> 00:08:21,879
My stomach hurts so much.

137
00:08:23,259 --> 00:08:25,420
I can't hold it. I need
to go to the outhouse.

138
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,759
How is it?

139
00:09:16,299 --> 00:09:18,120
I feel so dizzy.

140
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,840
Oh, no.

141
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,139
That scum must

142
00:09:30,539 --> 00:09:31,860
have tampered with the soup.

143
00:09:33,299 --> 00:09:34,799
That villain!

144
00:09:59,526 --> 00:10:03,117
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

145
00:10:03,117 --> 00:10:05,904
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

146
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,642
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

147
00:10:08,642 --> 00:10:11,488
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

148
00:10:11,488 --> 00:10:14,766
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

149
00:10:14,766 --> 00:10:16,400
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

150
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:18,464
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

151
00:10:18,464 --> 00:10:20,000
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

152
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,782
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

153
00:10:23,231 --> 00:10:25,136
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

154
00:10:25,136 --> 00:10:31,167
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

155
00:10:31,749 --> 00:10:35,632
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

156
00:10:35,632 --> 00:10:38,857
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

157
00:10:39,369 --> 00:10:41,968
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

158
00:10:41,968 --> 00:10:47,096
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

159
00:10:47,096 --> 00:10:50,624
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

160
00:10:50,624 --> 00:10:54,332
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

161
00:10:54,332 --> 00:10:56,224
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

162
00:10:56,224 --> 00:10:58,301
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

163
00:10:58,301 --> 00:11:00,832
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

164
00:11:00,832 --> 00:11:04,869
♪You met the most precious person♪

165
00:11:06,537 --> 00:11:08,400
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

166
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:10,919
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

167
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:12,368
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

168
00:11:12,368 --> 00:11:14,670
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

169
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:16,640
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

170
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:21,050
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

171
00:11:21,050 --> 00:11:22,592
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

172
00:11:22,592 --> 00:11:24,502
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

173
00:11:24,502 --> 00:11:27,776
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

174
00:11:27,776 --> 00:11:31,097
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

175
00:11:31,097 --> 00:11:32,832
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

176
00:11:32,832 --> 00:11:37,456
♪Just catch your breath first♪

177
00:11:37,456 --> 00:11:41,206
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

178
00:11:41,206 --> 00:11:44,584
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

179
00:11:44,958 --> 00:11:46,928
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

180
00:11:46,928 --> 00:11:52,675
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

181
00:11:52,675 --> 00:11:56,191
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

182
00:11:56,191 --> 00:11:57,760
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

183
00:11:57,760 --> 00:12:00,070
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

184
00:12:00,070 --> 00:12:01,808
♪From laughter to devotion♪

185
00:12:01,808 --> 00:12:03,864
♪From falling to innocence♪

186
00:12:03,864 --> 00:12:05,712
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

187
00:12:05,712 --> 00:12:12,382
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
